{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":42211,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041c6ae799ed0a7a6fc1af8346673cda","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Assets cloned: 71 components in `■ Assets` (10:117). Now build the shared components. I'll create a \"■ Components\" frame next to assets and define helper functions in each call.\n\nComponents to build:\n1. Social group\n2. Button sizes (I'll make 3 non-component styled buttons: lg 60h, md 50h, sm 44h) — as reusable components: `Button / lg`, `Button / md`, `Button / sm`.\n3. Nav item / default + current\n4. NavLink / Home, Recipes, Blog, Contact, About us (components with reactions)\n5. Header (component, with nav links instances)\n6. Footer\n7. Newsletter\n8. Recipe card (290×316) with Favorite toggle\n9. Category tile\n10. Chip / time + category\n11. Instagram post card\n12. Promo / Ad card\n13. Tasty recipe item (sidebar)\n14. Article list item\n15. Pagination item\n16. Ingredient item\n17. Direction step (maybe just build in place — but reusable is nice)\n18. Nutrition row\n19. Search bar\n20. Select field\n21. Recommended recipe card (small, 300×150)\n22. Author/meta bits as needed inline.\n\nThis is a lot. Let me build them in 2-3 calls.\n\nCall: Components A (primitives): buttons (3), nav item, chip, favorite btn, social group, category tile.\n\nI'll write a reusable helper script header each time. Let me carefully define positions. The components frame: place at x = 0, y = 900 (below assets, which is 748 high). Frame \"■ Components\", width 4700, clips false.\n\nLet me define text helper with fill. Fonts: Inter Regular/Medium/Semi Bold/Bold loaded.\n\nType scale:\n- H1 display: 64 Semi Bold (hero title), tracking -2%\n- H2 section: 48 Semi Bold\n- H3 card title: 24 Semi Bold\n- H4: 20 Semi Bold\n- Body: 16 Regular lh 160%\n- Small: 14 Medium\n- Tiny label: 12 Medium tracking +8% uppercase? \n\nColors:\n- Ink: #000000\n- Body gray: rgba(0,0,0,0.6)\n- Muted: rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\n- Surface: #FFFFFF\n- Tint: #E7F9FD\n- Tint2: #D6F6FC\n- Chip bg: rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\n- Border: rgba(0,0,0,0.1)\n- Favorite: #FF375E\n\nNow, Button lg: 160? Let me define:\n- `Button / lg`: height 60, padding 36, text 16 Semi Bold, radius 16, black bg, white text.\n- `Button / md`: height 50, padding 28, text 15 Semi Bold, radius 14.\n- `Button / sm`: height 44, padding 24, text 14 Semi Bold, radius 12.\n\nNav item: `Nav Item / Default` text 16 Medium, color rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding 8 16. `Nav Item / Current`: text 16 Semi Bold black + underline indicator? Use pill: bg rgba(0,0,0,0.05) radius 999? Underline: bottom bar 2px black. I'll do pill background #E7F9FD? Hmm — brand tint is nice for current state. Current nav item: text black Semi Bold with a small dot? Let me use underline (2px black) — clean and clearly \"selected\".\n\nChip: bg rgba(0,0,0,0.05), radius 999, icon 20 + text 14 Medium color rgba(0,0,0,0.6), padding 8 16, gap 8.\n\nFavorite: circle 48 white bg, heart 22 centered; default heart rgba(0,0,0,0.15)?? Actually default gray #D0D0D0, favorited #FF375E. Shadow small.\n\nSocial group: 3 icons 22px spaced 40. Facebook 10×20 — keep original sizes in 22px boxes.\n\nCategory tile: 148×176: rounded rect 24, gradient? Category cut-outs sit on soft tint bg. Gradient from transparent to tint at bottom is classic foodieland. I'll do solid tint background with radius 24, image 120 centered at top (y=12?), label 16 Semi Bold below. But image is 120×120 FIT — the cut-out includes plate shadow. Let me: tile 148w, bg tint rounded 24, image 120×120 at y=8, text at bottom (y=136), 16 Semi Bold centered. Height = 176.\n\nLet me write Components A now.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"d67ed3e4-25fd-455b-88c3-9c18db051c2a","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:59:02.883Z","thinking_duration_ms":22609}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":42211,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041c6ae799ed0a7a6fc1af8346673cda","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_14_b3e018d7","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"jlYo1Mf0FWeLZM7LsB5lKa","code":"const fonts = [['Inter','Regular'],['Inter','Medium'],['Inter','Semi Bold'],['Inter','Bold']];\nfor (const [family, style] of fonts) await figma.loadFontAsync({family, style});\nconst page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.startsWith('03 · Workspace'));\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst assets = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('10:117');\nconst M = {}; for (const c of assets.children) M[c.name] = c;\n\nconst TINT = {r:0.9058823529411765, g:0.9764705882352941, b:0.9921568627450981};\nconst BLACK = {r:0,g:0,b:0}, WHITE = {r:1,g:1,b:1};\nconst RED = {r:1, g:0.21568627450980393, b:0.3686274509803922};\nfunction solid(c,a){ const p={type:'SOLID',color:c}; if(a!==undefined)p.opacity=a; return p; }\nfunction text(chars, style, size, opts={}){\n  const t = figma.createText();\n  t.fontName = {family:'Inter', style};\n  t.fontSize = size; t.characters = chars;\n  t.fills = opts.fills || [solid(BLACK, opts.alpha!==undefined?opts.alpha:1)];\n  if(opts.lh) t.lineHeight = {unit:'PERCENT', value:opts.lh};\n  if(opts.ls) t.letterSpacing = {unit:'PERCENT', value:opts.ls};\n  return t;\n}\nfunction frame(name){ const f=figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; f.fills=[]; f.clipsContent=true; return f; }\nfunction al(f, mode, opts={}){\n  f.layoutMode=mode;\n  f.primaryAxisSizingMode=opts.pSize||'AUTO'; f.counterAxisSizingMode=opts.cSize||'AUTO';\n  f.itemSpacing=opts.gap||0;\n  f.paddingLeft=opts.pl||0; f.paddingRight=opts.pr||0; f.paddingTop=opts.pt||0; f.paddingBottom=opts.pb||0;\n  if(opts.align) f.counterAxisAlignItems=opts.align;\n  if(opts.justify) f.primaryAxisAlignItems=opts.justify;\n  return f;\n}\nfunction rect(name,w,h,fill,cr){ const r=figma.createRectangle(); r.name=name; r.resize(w,h); r.fills=fill?[fill]:[]; if(cr!==undefined)r.cornerRadius=cr; return r; }\nfunction tint(n,color){ if('fills' in n){ try{n.fills=[solid(color)];}catch(e){} } if('children' in n) n.children.forEach(c=>tint(c,color)); }\nfunction inst(comp, w, h){ const i = comp.createInstance(); if(w&&h) i.resize(w,h); else if(w) i.resize(w, i.height*w/comp.width); return i; }\n\nconst COMP = frame('■ Components');\nCOMP.clipsContent = false;\npage.appendChild(COMP); COMP.x = 0; COMP.y = assets.y + assets.height + 160;\n\nconst built = {};\nlet cx = 0, cy = 0, rowH = 0;\nfunction put(comp, gap=120){ COMP.appendChild(comp); comp.x=cx; comp.y=cy; cx+=comp.width+gap; rowH=Math.max(rowH,comp.height); if(cx>4200){cx=0;cy+=rowH+120;rowH=0;} built[comp.name]=comp.id; }\nfunction newComp(name){ const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name=name; c.fills=[]; c.clipsContent=true; return c; }\n\n// ---- Button / lg ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Button / lg');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:36,pr:36,pt:0,pb:0,align:'CENTER',justify:'CENTER'});\n  c.fills=[solid(BLACK)]; c.cornerRadius=16;\n  const t=text('Button','Semi Bold',16,{fills:[solid(WHITE)]}); t.name='Label';\n  c.appendChild(t); c.resize(Math.max(c.width,160),60);\n  c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  put(c);\n}\n// ---- Button / md ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Button / md');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:28,pr:28,align:'CENTER',justify:'CENTER'});\n  c.fills=[solid(BLACK)]; c.cornerRadius=14;\n  const t=text('Button','Semi Bold',15,{fills:[solid(WHITE)]}); t.name='Label';\n  c.appendChild(t); c.resize(Math.max(c.width,120),50);\n  put(c);\n}\n// ---- Button / sm ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Button / sm');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:24,pr:24,align:'CENTER',justify:'CENTER'});\n  c.fills=[solid(BLACK)]; c.cornerRadius=12;\n  const t=text('Button','Semi Bold',14,{fills:[solid(WHITE)]}); t.name='Label';\n  c.appendChild(t); c.resize(Math.max(c.width,96),44);\n  put(c);\n}\n// ---- Nav Item / Default & Current ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Nav Item / Default');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:16,pr:16,pt:10,pb:10,gap:0});\n  const t=text('Nav Item','Medium',16,{alpha:0.6}); t.name='Label';\n  c.appendChild(t);\n  put(c, 40);\n  const c2 = newComp('Nav Item / Current');\n  al(c2,'VERTICAL',{pl:0,pr:0,pt:0,pb:0,gap:4,align:'CENTER'});\n  const row = frame('Label row'); al(row,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:16,pr:16,pt:10,pb:8});\n  const t2=text('Nav Item','Semi Bold',16,{}); t2.name='Label';\n  row.appendChild(t2);\n  const bar = rect('Indicator',24,2,solid(BLACK),1);\n  c2.appendChild(row); c2.appendChild(bar);\n  put(c2, 120);\n}\n// ---- Chip (icon + label) ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Chip');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:16,pr:16,pt:8,pb:8,gap:10,align:'CENTER'});\n  c.fills=[solid(BLACK,0.05)]; c.cornerRadius=999;\n  const ic = inst(M.Icon_Timer,20,20); tint(ic,{r:0,g:0,b:0}); ic.opacity=1; tint(ic,BLACK);\n  const t=text('30 Minutes','Medium',14,{alpha:0.6}); t.name='Label';\n  c.appendChild(ic); c.appendChild(t);\n  put(c);\n}\n// ---- Favorite / Default & Active ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Favorite / Default');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:0,pr:0,pt:0,pb:0,align:'CENTER',justify:'CENTER'});\n  c.fills=[solid(WHITE)]; c.cornerRadius=999;\n  c.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0,g:0,b:0,a:0.08},offset:{x:0,y:4},radius:12,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n  const ic = inst(M.Icon_Favorite,22,22); tint(ic,{r:0.78,g:0.78,b:0.78});\n  c.appendChild(ic); c.resize(48,48);\n  put(c,40);\n  const c2 = newComp('Favorite / Active');\n  al(c2,'HORIZONTAL',{align:'CENTER',justify:'CENTER'});\n  c2.fills=[solid(WHITE)]; c2.cornerRadius=999;\n  c2.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0,g:0,b:0,a:0.08},offset:{x:0,y:4},radius:12,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n  const ic2 = inst(M.Icon_Favorite,22,22); tint(ic2,RED);\n  c2.appendChild(ic2); c2.resize(48,48);\n  put(c2,120);\n}\n// ---- Social group ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Social Group');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{gap:40,align:'CENTER'});\n  for (const n of ['Logo_Facebook','Logo_Instagram','Logo_Twitter']) {\n    const holder = frame(n); al(holder,'HORIZONTAL',{align:'CENTER',justify:'CENTER'});\n    holder.resize(22,22);\n    const i = inst(M[n]); i.resize(Math.min(i.width,22), Math.min(i.height,22));\n    holder.appendChild(i);\n    c.appendChild(holder);\n  }\n  put(c);\n}\n// ---- Category tile ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Category Tile');\n  al(c,'VERTICAL',{pt:12,pb:20,pl:14,pr:14,gap:10,align:'CENTER'});\n  c.fills=[solid(TINT)]; c.cornerRadius=24;\n  const img = inst(M.Category_Breakfast,110,110); img.name='Image';\n  const t = text('Breakfast','Semi Bold',16); t.name='Label';\n  c.appendChild(img); c.appendChild(t);\n  c.resize(148, Math.round(c.height));\n  put(c);\n}\n// ---- Play button (round) ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Play Button');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{align:'CENTER',justify:'CENTER'});\n  c.fills=[solid(WHITE)]; c.cornerRadius=999;\n  c.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0,g:0,b:0,a:0.15},offset:{x:0,y:8},radius:24,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n  const ic = inst(M.Icon_Play,28,28); tint(ic,BLACK);\n  c.appendChild(ic); c.resize(72,72);\n  put(c);\n}\n// ---- Action button (PRINT/SHARE circle) ----\n{\n  const c = newComp('Action Button');\n  al(c,'HORIZONTAL',{align:'CENTER',justify:'CENTER'});\n  c.fills=[solid(TINT)]; c.cornerRadius=999;\n  const ic = inst(M.Icon_Print,22,22); tint(ic,BLACK); ic.name='Icon';\n  c.appendChild(ic); c.resize(56,56);\n  put(c);\n}\nCOMP.resize(4400, cy + rowH + 40);\nreturn built;","description":"Build primitive components: buttons, nav items, chip, favorite, social group, category tile, play & action buttons"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"d83ad6b0-d1e8-455f-a2ca-9daa43a6301b","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:59:28.868Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_14_b3e018d7","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
