{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":52049,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"08196ae79b410a7ae3cb9479fa80f1e3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait — the chip component's children: Icon_Timer instance, Icon_Fork_Knife instance, Label. But the label position — original Chip was [icon(timer), Label]. I inserted fork at index 1 → [timer, fork(hidden), Label]. In an instance, to make a fork chip: hide timer instance, show fork instance. \n\nNow build business components batch 2 again (without c2i.remove).","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"38a97f15-b28c-415e-97c4-4da50fa2056a","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:04:28.361Z","thinking_duration_ms":2136}
