+name+date), right column sidebar 360: Tasty Recipes (3 mini items) + promo card. 6 articles stacked.\n\nArticle Item: width 800, image 300x210 rounded 20, gap 28, right col: Title 20 SemiBold (2 lines), excerpt 15 Regular alpha .6, author row: avatar 40, name 14 semibold, dot, date 14 alpha .6.\n\nThen Call F: 01_Home assembly (huge).\nCall G: 02_Recipe.\nCall H: 03_Blog + 04_Blog_Post.\nCall I: 05_Contact.\nCall J: prototype wiring.\nCall K: screenshots + fixes.\n\nLet me write Call E now: Header builder is per page — skip component; build Article Item component only, plus \"Recommended Section\" maybe as a builder on pages directly.\n\nAlso need \"Section heading\" pattern — inline per page.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"5a33b68f-99b6-44e2-a3a3-76d67a50a8e8","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:06:53.917Z","thinking_duration_ms":12256}
