gular 14 alpha 0.6), divider? ; View Recipes pill (H pl 36 pr 8 pt 8 pb 8 gap 16, black, radius 999? radius 16 per buttons; but with inner circle radius 999 works: outer radius 999): label \"View Recipes\" white semibold 16 + circle 44 white radius 999 with Icon_Play 18 black.\n- Right col: 640×640 wrap radius 32, photo fill; badge: circle 150, x=640-150-28=462, y=28. Badge inner: text \"Handpicked\\nRecipes\" centered 14 semibold, with dashed border: strokes dashPattern [3,3].\nTitle: \"Spicy delicious chicken wings\" — brief says title exactly that.\n\nBadge text: \"Handpicked Recipes\".\n\nCategories: tiles instance: swap image component (child named 'Image' is instance of Category_Breakfast) → swapComponent(M.Category_X); label text.\n\nCategory list: Breakfast, Vegan, Meat, Dessert, Lunch, Chocolate (brief order).\n\nInstagram posts captions (exact):\n1. The vegetable dishes need to have certain vitamins for those people\n2. Sweet food can bring someone happiness, as long as they don't eat too much\n3. What do you do before you start cooking? Prepare the tools or the ingredients?\n4. Steak is never wrong; it's perfect if you want a romantic dinner\n\nHeader nav: nav row centered: I'll make nav container layoutGrow=1, H AL justify CENTER gap 48; items: Home(Current), Recipes, Blog, Contact, About us (Default instances, label edits).\n\nPage frame: 1440 w, V AL, fill white, clipsContent true? Page scroll—set clipsContent false? Frames as screens: clipsContent true fine.\n\nLet me also handle \"current page\" indicator: Nav Item / Current has bar 24×2 — includes label row + bar.\n\nWrite Call A now. Helper prelude — I'll define helpers compactly. Also map media components by name from assets each call.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"38ccb0f8-af82-4cdf-ba39-afd744c6ca0b","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:08:27.709Z","thinking_duration_ms":79931}
