{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":80742,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041e6ae79d040a7a74ab5b9d5a614825","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait — Chef Promo was appended after Instagram? The order should be: Header, Hero, Categories, Simple and Tasty, Chef Promo, Instagram, More Recipes, Newsletter, Footer. Actually looking at the result: sections are Header, Hero, Categories, Simple and Tasty, Chef Promo, Instagram. Chef Promo was appended in call 1 (which failed at instagram), and then in the retry both were appended again? No — the first call errored at Instagram (line 80) — Chef promo had already been appended in the first call! Then retry appended Chef Promo again AND Instagram. But the sections list shows only one Chef Promo... Let me look: sections = [Header, Hero, Categories, Simple and Tasty, Chef Promo, Instagram] — only 6. So no duplicate? \n\nHmm, wait: in the first (failed) call, Chef Promo was appended to home. In the second call, I appended Chef Promo again (a second one) + Instagram. That would give 7 sections with two Chef Promos. But list shows 6 with one Chef Promo... \n\nOh! I see — in the first failed call, the error was at line 80 which is inside the Instagram section (post caption line). Chef Promo section was appended before that. So after call 1: [Header, Hero, Categories, Simple and Tasty, Chef Promo].\n\nBut the state check after that showed only [Header, Hero, Categories, Simple and Tasty] — h 220 for Simple and Tasty. No Chef Promo! Because the whole call is transactional? The first failed call's changes were rolled back entirely. That's why Categories/Simple and Tasty had to be redone. And my successful redo call showed sections [Header, Hero, Categories, Simple and Tasty] with homeH 1441.\n\nThen in this last call: [Header, Hero, Categories, Simple and Tasty, Chef Promo, Instagram] — exactly what I wanted. \n\nNow add More Recipes, Newsletter, Footer to home.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"67eac4b6-6b41-4f0a-8ce3-9a000ecef522","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:11:59.129Z","thinking_duration_ms":8348}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":80742,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"041e6ae79d040a7a74ab5b9d5a614825","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_35_74fd6b64","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"jlYo1Mf0FWeLZM7LsB5lKa","code":"const fonts = [['Inter','Regular'],['Inter','Medium'],['Inter','Semi Bold'],['Inter','Bold']];\nfor (const [family, style] of fonts) await figma.loadFontAsync({family, style});\nconst page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.startsWith('03 · Workspace'));\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst assets = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('10:117');\nconst M = {}; for (const c of assets.children) M[c.name] = c;\nconst COMP = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('11:4');\nconst byName = n => COMP.children.find(c => c.name === n);\nconst home = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('15:48');\n\nconst BLACK = {r:0,g:0,b:0}, WHITE = {r:1,g:1,b:1};\nfunction solid(c,a){ const p={type:'SOLID',color:c}; if(a!==undefined)p.opacity=a; return p; }\nfunction text(chars, style, size, opts={}){\n  const t = figma.createText();\n  t.fontName = {family:'Inter', style}; t.fontSize = size; t.characters = chars;\n  t.fills = opts.fills || [solid(BLACK, opts.alpha!==undefined?opts.alpha:1)];\n  if(opts.lh) t.lineHeight = {unit:'PERCENT', value:opts.lh};\n  return t;\n}\nfunction frame(name){ const f=figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; f.fills=[]; f.clipsContent=true; return f; }\nfunction al(f, mode, opts={}){\n  f.layoutMode=mode;\n  f.primaryAxisSizingMode=opts.pSize||'AUTO'; f.counterAxisSizingMode=opts.cSize||'AUTO';\n  f.itemSpacing=opts.gap||0;\n  f.paddingLeft=opts.pl||0; f.paddingRight=opts.pr||0; f.paddingTop=opts.pt||0; f.paddingBottom=opts.pb||0;\n  if(opts.align) f.counterAxisAlignItems=opts.align;\n  if(opts.justify) f.primaryAxisAlignItems=opts.justify;\n  if(opts.wrap) f.layoutWrap='WRAP';\n  return f;\n}\n\n// ---------- More recipes ----------\n{\n  const more = [['Photo_Tropical_Fruit_Salad','Mixed Tropical Fruit Salad with Superfood Boosts','Healthy',true],\n    ['Photo_Wagyu_Cheeseburger_Alt','Big and Juicy Wagyu Beef Cheeseburger','Western',false],\n    ['Photo_Japanese_Fried_Rice','Healthy Japanese Fried Rice with Asparagus','Healthy',false],\n    ['Photo_Cauliflower_Taco','Cauliflower Walnut Vegetarian Taco Meat','Eastern',false],\n    ['Photo_Rainbow_Chicken_Salad','Rainbow Chicken Salad with Almond Honey Mustard Dressing','Healthy',true],\n    ['Photo_Barbeque_Sandwiches','Barbeque Spicy Sandwiches with Chips','Snack',false],\n    ['Photo_Vegan_Lettuce_Wraps','Firecracker Vegan Lettuce Wraps - Spicy!','Vegan',false],\n    ['Photo_Chicken_Ramen','Chicken Ramen Soup with Mushroom','Japanese',true]];\n  const sec = frame('More Recipes');\n  al(sec,'VERTICAL',{pl:80,pr:80,pt:72,pb:72,gap:40});\n  const head = frame('Head'); al(head,'HORIZONTAL',{gap:48,align:'CENTER'});\n  const t = text('Try this delicious recipe to make your day','Bold',40,{lh:125}); t.name='Title';\n  t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(560,t.height);\n  const c = text('Fresh ideas for breakfast, lunch and dinner — pick one and get cooking.','Regular',16,{alpha:0.6,lh:170});\n  c.name='Copy'; c.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; c.resize(560,c.height);\n  head.appendChild(t); head.appendChild(c);\n  t.layoutGrow=1;\n  sec.appendChild(head); head.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  const grid = frame('Grid'); al(grid,'HORIZONTAL',{gap:32,wrap:true});\n  grid.counterAxisSpacing = 32;\n  grid.resize(1280, 10);\n  for (const [p,tt,cat,fav] of more) {\n    const card = byName('Recipe Card').createInstance();\n    const imgWrap = card.findOne(n => n.name==='Image');\n    const photoInst = imgWrap.children[0];\n    photoInst.mainComponent = M[p];\n    photoInst.resize(266,180);\n    card.findOne(n=>n.name==='Title').characters = tt;\n    const chips = card.findOne(n=>n.name==='Meta');\n    chips.children[0].findOne(n=>n.name==='Label').characters = '30 Minutes';\n    chips.children[1].findOne(n=>n.name==='Label').characters = cat;\n    if (fav) imgWrap.children[1].mainComponent = byName('Favorite / Active');\n    card.name = 'Card / ' + tt;\n    grid.appendChild(card);\n  }\n  sec.appendChild(grid); grid.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  sec.resize(1440, Math.round(sec.height));\n  home.appendChild(sec); sec.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n}\n\n// ---------- Newsletter ----------\n{\n  const sec = frame('Newsletter');\n  al(sec,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:80,pr:80,pt:32,pb:80,justify:'CENTER'});\n  const card = byName('Newsletter Card').createInstance();\n  sec.appendChild(card);\n  sec.resize(1440, Math.round(sec.height));\n  home.appendChild(sec); sec.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n}\n\n// ---------- Footer ----------\n{\n  const footer = byName('Footer').createInstance();\n  home.appendChild(footer); footer.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n}\n\nhome.resize(1440, Math.round(home.height));\nreturn { homeH: home.height, sections: home.children.map(c=>c.name) };","description":"Add More Recipes, Newsletter and Footer to 01_Home"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"264e2ff4-fab2-4d64-a223-1038681fed55","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:12:08.635Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_35_74fd6b64","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
