{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":104169,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"080f6ae79e7d0a7a570a3dd7cdaea0b7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The instance error: `content.appendChild(imgWrap)` — content was found via `st.findOne(n=>n.name==='Content')`. But st is an instance of Direction Step, so its Content child is inside the instance — appending fails. I need to restructure: make Direction Step flexible by including the photo in the master? Options:\n\n1. Add an optional hidden \"Step Photo\" frame (with Photo_Cooking_Step) to the Direction Step master; show it only for step 1. That keeps single component. But photo only needed once — hidden child overhead fine.\n\n2. Detach instances for steps (lose reuse).\n\nGo with option 1: add hidden photo child named \"Step Photo\" inside master's Content (after Body), plus hidden \"Body 2\" text. In instances, set visible=true and text for step 1.\n\nNote the earlier weirdness where a hidden instance child vanished from instances — that was insertChild on a component mid-session possibly bugged. I'll try again; verify after.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"daf92494-8ee2-49c1-9c69-749cd48a9afd","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:18:16.406Z","thinking_duration_ms":4530}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":104169,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"080f6ae79e7d0a7a570a3dd7cdaea0b7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_60_e6060eb6","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"jlYo1Mf0FWeLZM7LsB5lKa","code":"const fonts = [['Inter','Regular'],['Inter','Medium'],['Inter','Semi Bold'],['Inter','Bold']];\nfor (const [family, style] of fonts) await figma.loadFontAsync({family, style});\nconst assets = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('10:117');\nconst M = {}; for (const c of assets.children) M[c.name] = c;\nconst COMP = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('11:4');\nconst byName = n => COMP.children.find(c => c.name === n);\nconst BLACK = {r:0,g:0,b:0};\nfunction solid(c,a){ const p={type:'SOLID',color:c}; if(a!==undefined)p.opacity=a; return p; }\n\n// Extend Direction Step master with hidden optional photo + extra body\nconst step = byName('Direction Step');\nconst content = step.children[1];\nconst imgWrap = figma.createFrame();\nimgWrap.name = 'Step Photo';\nimgWrap.fills = [];\nimgWrap.cornerRadius = 20;\nimgWrap.clipsContent = true;\nimgWrap.layoutAlign = 'STRETCH';\nimgWrap.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; imgWrap.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\nimgWrap.resize(650, 280);\nconst img = M.Photo_Cooking_Step.createInstance();\nimg.resize(650, 280);\nimgWrap.appendChild(img);\ncontent.appendChild(imgWrap);\nconst extra = figma.createText();\nextra.name = 'Body 2';\nextra.fontName = {family:'Inter', style:'Regular'};\nextra.fontSize = 16;\nextra.characters = 'Extra text.';\nextra.fills = [solid(BLACK, 0.6)];\nextra.lineHeight = {unit:'PERCENT', value:160};\nextra.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';\nextra.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\ncontent.appendChild(extra);\nimgWrap.visible = false;\nextra.visible = false;\nstep.resize(700, Math.round(step.height));\n\n// verify instance sees them\nconst test = step.createInstance();\nconst names = [];\ntest.findAll(n => names.push(n.name + ':' + n.visible));\ntest.remove();\nreturn { found: names };","description":"Add hidden optional photo and extra body to Direction Step master"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"709d7181-5f4f-4c6b-82f0-8b3a36574b94","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:18:21.296Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_60_e6060eb6","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
