{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":112484,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"020f6ae79ef70a7a03ed2f3e99ad1840","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Mini item: col width 160, title wraps to 4 lines (h=72 at 18px... shows 4 lines in screenshot because column is 160 wide). The sidebar is 360 wide; image 180 + gap 20 = 200, so col should be 160. Title at 18px in 160px width → many lines. Screenshot shows title column very narrow (~90px). Hmm, in screenshot the image is ~60px wide at scale... let me compute: sidebar 360 at scale 0.45 = 162px; image 180→81px; gap 20→9; col 160→72px. Yes col is 72px on screen — matches the narrow look. So it's actually correct, just narrow by design. \"Chicken Meatballs with Cream Cheese\" at 18px in 160px → 4-5 lines. In screenshot it shows 4 lines (\"Chicken / Meatballs with / Cream / Cheese\"). It's tall but OK-ish. Improve: reduce title font to 16 and image to 160x110? Or keep. Actually original Foodieland sidebar items have image 180x120 and text beside with ~150px width. It's fine but let me reduce title fontSize to 16 with max 3 lines — acceptable.\n\nActually in my recipe the mini item is within a 360 sidebar, fine. The screenshot cut shows the col is 160 wide. It's fine. Leave it but reduce font to 16 to reduce wrapping.\n\nLet me also fix the master Mini Recipe Item col width. The master is 360 wide. It's fine.\n\nNext: build 03_Blog.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"ad5dfa86-cab4-4293-9d76-595da8a433e0","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:20:21.449Z","thinking_duration_ms":7307}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":112484,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"020f6ae79ef70a7a03ed2f3e99ad1840","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_66_6daf4ab4","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"jlYo1Mf0FWeLZM7LsB5lKa","code":"const fonts = [['Inter','Regular'],['Inter','Medium'],['Inter','Semi Bold'],['Inter','Bold']];\nfor (const [family, style] of fonts) await figma.loadFontAsync({family, style});\nconst page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.startsWith('03 · Workspace'));\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst assets = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('10:117');\nconst M = {}; for (const c of assets.children) M[c.name] = c;\nconst COMP = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('11:4');\nconst byName = n => COMP.children.find(c => c.name === n);\nconst BLACK = {r:0,g:0,b:0}, WHITE = {r:1,g:1,b:1};\nfunction solid(c,a){ const p={type:'SOLID',color:c}; if(a!==undefined)p.opacity=a; return p; }\nfunction text(chars, style, size, opts={}){\n  const t = figma.createText();\n  t.fontName = {family:'Inter', style}; t.fontSize = size; t.characters = chars;\n  t.fills = opts.fills || [solid(BLACK, opts.alpha!==undefined?opts.alpha:1)];\n  if(opts.lh) t.lineHeight = {unit:'PERCENT', value:opts.lh};\n  if(opts.align) t.textAlignHorizontal = opts.align;\n  return t;\n}\nfunction frame(name){ const f=figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; f.fills=[]; f.clipsContent=true; return f; }\nfunction al(f, mode, opts={}){\n  f.layoutMode=mode;\n  f.primaryAxisSizingMode=opts.pSize||'AUTO'; f.counterAxisSizingMode=opts.cSize||'AUTO';\n  f.itemSpacing=opts.gap||0;\n  f.paddingLeft=opts.pl||0; f.paddingRight=opts.pr||0; f.paddingTop=opts.pt||0; f.paddingBottom=opts.pb||0;\n  if(opts.align) f.counterAxisAlignItems=opts.align;\n  if(opts.justify) f.primaryAxisAlignItems=opts.justify;\n  return f;\n}\nfunction inst(comp, w, h){ const i = comp.createInstance(); if(w&&h) i.resize(w,h); else if(w) i.resize(w, i.height*w/comp.width); return i; }\nfunction setCurrentNav(headerInst, current){\n  const nav = headerInst.findOne(n=>n.name==='Nav');\n  for (const ni of nav.children) {\n    const label = ni.findOne(n=>n.name==='Label').characters;\n    ni.mainComponent = byName(label===current ? 'Nav Item / Current' : 'Nav Item / Default');\n  }\n}\nfunction headerInstance(current){\n  const h = byName('Header / Home').createInstance();\n  setCurrentNav(h, current);\n  h.name='Header';\n  return h;\n}\nfunction miniItem(photo, title){\n  const c = byName('Mini Recipe Item').createInstance();\n  const iw = c.children[0];\n  iw.children[0].mainComponent = M[photo];\n  iw.children[0].resize(180,120);\n  const tt = c.findOne(n=>n.name==='Title');\n  tt.characters = title; tt.fontSize = 16;\n  c.findOne(n=>n.name==='Byline').characters = 'By Andreas Paula';\n  return c;\n}\nfunction newsletterSection(page){\n  const nl = frame('Newsletter');\n  al(nl,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:80,pr:80,pt:32,pb:80,justify:'CENTER'});\n  nl.appendChild(byName('Newsletter Card').createInstance());\n  nl.resize(1440, Math.round(nl.height));\n  page.appendChild(nl); nl.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n}\nfunction footerSection(page){\n  const footer = byName('Footer').createInstance();\n  page.appendChild(footer); footer.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n}\n\n// reduce mini item title size in master too\nbyName('Mini Recipe Item').findOne(n=>n.name==='Title').fontSize = 16;\n\n// ---------- 03_Blog ----------\nconst blog = frame('03_Blog');\nblog.fills=[solid(WHITE)];\nal(blog,'VERTICAL',{});\nblog.clipsContent = false;\npage.appendChild(blog); blog.x = 3200; blog.y = 3600;\n\nblog.appendChild(headerInstance('Blog'));\nblog.children[0].layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n\n// Page intro + search\n{\n  const sec = frame('Intro & Search');\n  al(sec,'VERTICAL',{pl:80,pr:80,pt:72,pb:56,gap:24,align:'CENTER'});\n  const t = text('Blog & Article','Bold',44,{align:'CENTER'}); t.name='Title';\n  const c = text('Recipes, kitchen tips and stories from the Foodieland team.','Regular',16,{alpha:0.6,align:'CENTER',lh:160});\n  c.name='Copy';\n  sec.appendChild(t); sec.appendChild(c);\n  const sb = byName('Search Bar').createInstance();\n  sec.appendChild(sb);\n  sec.resize(1440, Math.round(sec.height));\n  blog.appendChild(sec); sec.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n}\n\n// Articles + sidebar\n{\n  const articles = [\n    ['Photo_Chicken_Ramen','Avatar_Wade_Warren','Crochet Projects for Noodle Lovers','Wade Warren','Our favourite slurpable noodle bowls, from quick ramen to slow-simmered broths.'],\n    ['Photo_Tropical_Fruit_Salad','Avatar_Robert_Fox','10 Vegetarian Recipes To Eat This Month','Robert Fox','Seasonal, meat-free dishes that are colourful, filling and easy to make.'],\n    ['Photo_Blog_Chef','Avatar_Dianne_Russell','Full Guide to Becoming a Professional Chef','Dianne Russell','A working head chef on first jobs, long services and what it really takes.'],\n    ['Photo_Vegetarian_Lasagna','Avatar_Leslie_Alexander','Simple & Delicious Vegetarian Lasagna','Leslie Alexander','Layers of roasted vegetables, rich tomato sauce and creamy béchamel.'],\n    ['Photo_Plantain_Stew','Avatar_Courtney_Henry','Plantain and Pinto Stew with Aji Verde','Courtney Henry','A hearty one-pot stew finished with a bright, herby green sauce.'],\n    ['Photo_Hiring','Avatar_Albert_Flores','We’re Hiring a Communications Assistant!','Albert Flores','Love food and words? Join our small team and help us tell more food stories.']\n  ];\n  const sec = frame('Articles & Sidebar');\n  al(sec,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:80,pr:80,pt:16,pb:32,gap:64,align:'MIN'});\n  const list = frame('Articles'); al(list,'VERTICAL',{gap:40});\n  for (const [photo, avatar, title, author, excerpt] of articles) {\n    const a = byName('Article Item').createInstance();\n    const iw = a.children[0];\n    iw.children[0].mainComponent = M[photo];\n    iw.children[0].resize(300,210);\n    a.findOne(n=>n.name==='Title').characters = title;\n    a.findOne(n=>n.name==='Excerpt').characters = excerpt;\n    const meta = a.findOne(n=>n.name==='Meta');\n    meta.children[0].mainComponent = M[avatar];\n    meta.children[0].resize(40,40);\n    meta.children[1].characters = author;\n    meta.children[3].characters = '12 November 2021';\n    a.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n    list.appendChild(a);\n  }\n  list.resize(800, Math.round(list.height));\n  sec.appendChild(list);\n  // sidebar\n  const side = frame('Sidebar'); al(side,'VERTICAL',{gap:40});\n  const tasty = frame('Tasty Recipes'); al(tasty,'VERTICAL',{gap:20});\n  tasty.appendChild(text('Tasty Recipes','Bold',24));\n  tasty.appendChild(miniItem('Photo_Chicken_Meatballs','Chicken Meatballs with Cream Cheese'));\n  tasty.appendChild(miniItem('Photo_Creamy_Chicken_Bacon_Pasta','Traditional Bolognaise Ragu'));\n  tasty.appendChild(miniItem('Photo_Dumplings','Pork and Chive Chinese Dumplings'));\n  side.appendChild(tasty);\n  const promo = byName('Promo Card').createInstance();\n  const ratio = promo.height/promo.width;\n  promo.resize(360, Math.round(360*ratio));\n  side.appendChild(promo);\n  side.resize(360, Math.round(side.height));\n  sec.appendChild(side);\n  sec.resize(1440, Math.round(sec.height));\n  blog.appendChild(sec); sec.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n}\n\n// Pagination\n{\n  const sec = frame('Pagination');\n  al(sec,'HORIZONTAL',{pl:80,pr:80,pt:8,pb:48,gap:16,justify:'CENTER',align:'CENTER'});\n  const mk = (master, label) => {\n    const it = byName(master).createInstance();\n    const lt = it.findOne(n=>n.name==='Label');\n    if (lt) lt.characters = label;\n    return it;\n  };\n  sec.appendChild(mk('Pagination Item / Current','1'));\n  sec.appendChild(mk('Pagination Item / Default','2'));\n  sec.appendChild(mk('Pagination Item / Default','3'));\n  sec.appendChild(mk('Pagination Item / Default','4'));\n  sec.appendChild(mk('Pagination Item / Default','5'));\n  const dots = text('…','Medium',16,{alpha:0.7}); dots.name='Ellipsis';\n  sec.appendChild(dots);\n  sec.appendChild(byName('Pagination Item / Next').createInstance());\n  sec.resize(1440, Math.round(sec.height));\n  blog.appendChild(sec); sec.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n}\n\nnewsletterSection(blog);\nfooterSection(blog);\nblog.resize(1440, Math.round(blog.height));\nreturn { blogId: blog.id, h: blog.height, secs: blog.children.map(c=>c.name) };","description":"Build 03_Blog: intro, search, 6 articles, tasty sidebar, promo, pagination, newsletter, footer"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb6a87e1-77d2-4750-aa78-08940da487c1","uuid":"f47bc22f-a263-4973-9e82-489938ef6217","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:20:40.145Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_66_6daf4ab4","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
